  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Short present stems of three to five words. The right choice adds will and keeps the same base verb. Wrong choices repeat the stem, use a simple past, or drop a helping word.",
    "2": "Grade-level stems with irregular past or a name. One distractor uses will plus the old past form, such as will ran or will went.",
    "3": "Near-miss helping verbs. Stems use has, are, or were. Wrong choices keep will has, will are, or will were."
  },
